+Migration Contract:
+    type: reversible
+    rollback_plan: "alembic downgrade -1（按 tasks.guide_json['plan_link_backfill']
+        回填标记精确还原：只回滚本迁移回填过的行，清 plan_id + 剥标记；intake/goal
+        等原生带 plan_id 的任务永不被触碰）"
